1
00:04:36,428 --> 00:04:42,428
Are you the exception... or are you the rule?

2
00:09:12,857 --> 00:09:18,857
He's Just Not That Into You is a comedy, romance,
drama film directed by Ken Kwapis.

3
00:13:49,285 --> 00:13:55,285
Have you ever sat by the phone wondering why he said he would call, but didn't, or you can't figure out why she
doesn't want to sleep with you anymore, or why your relationship just isn't going to the next level...

4
00:18:25,714 --> 00:18:31,714
they're just not that into you.

5
