Janine's not sure if she can trust her husband, Ben, who
can't quite trust himself around Anna.

8
00:36:51,428 --> 00:36:57,428
Anna can't decide between the sexy married guy, or her straightforward, no-sparks
standby, Conor, who can't get over the fact that he can't have her.

9
