Ben Gunders, played by Bradley Cooper.

16
01:13:42,857 --> 01:13:48,857
He's Just Not That into You is a 2009 American-German romantic comedy-drama film directed by Ken
Kwapis, based on Greg Behrendt and Liz Tuccillo's 2004 self-help book of the same name.

17
01:18:19,285 --> 01:18:25,285
It follows nine people and their varying romantic problems.

18
01:22:55,714 --> 01:23:01,714
Gigi, a common thread amongst the characters, is followed more closely than the other eight and has a more
developed storyline as she consistently misreads all of her romantic partners' behaviors.

19
01:27:32,142 --> 01:27:38,142
She meets Alex, who helps her to interpret signs given to her by her dates.

20
01:32:08,571 --> 01:32:14,571
The film stars an ensemble cast of Ben Affleck, Jennifer Aniston, Drew Barrymore, Jennifer Connelly,
Kevin Connolly, Bradley Cooper, Ginnifer Goodwin, Scarlett Johansson, and Justin Long.

21
01:36:45,000 --> 01:36:51,000
The film was produced by New Line Cinema and Flower Films, the production company
owned by Barrymore, who is also the film's executive producer.

22
01:41:21,428 --> 01:41:27,428
Production began in Baltimore in 2007.

23
01:45:57,857 --> 01:46:03,857
The film was released on February 6, 2009, by Warner Bros.

24
01:50:34,285 --> 01:50:40,285
Pictures to mixed reviews.

25
01:55:10,714 --> 01:55:16,714
It grossed $27.7 million on its opening weekend
and over $178.8 million worldwide.

26
01:59:47,142 --> 01:59:53,142
The film explores themes of friendship, based on novel or book,
married couple, relationship problems, relationship.

27
02:04:23,571 --> 02:04:29,571
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
